# A Phantasmal Image that copies another Image enters as what that one copied (CR 707.3), Guerrilla Gorilla, with the first
# Image's Illusion type and sacrifice ability among the values it copied (CR 707.9b) — and its own exception adds the
# ability again, so it has two. Illusion is a type it already has, so it is an Illusion once. Bot2's Bolt at it
# triggers both (CR 603.2): two abilities above the Bolt; the first sacrifices it, the second finds nothing to do, and
# the Bolt is countered for want of a target (CR 608.2b). The first Image, never targeted, stays.

